  "title": "Federal Budget 2026: Why New Apartments Could Become the Future of Property Investing",
  "summary": "With proposed reforms to negative gearing and capital gains tax (CGT), the way Australians invest in property may be about to change significantly. And while many headlines have focused on what investors could lose, there is another side to the story: new apartments and off-the-plan developments may become increasingly attractive under the new rules.",
